# API

- FastAPI + SQLAlchemy 2 + Alembic. PostgreSQL in staging/prod; SQLite allowed only for local tests.
- Version routes `/api/v1/`.
- WebSocket `/ws/live` for manager presence (online, last activity, last screenshot thumb).
- Punches: `sign_in`, `break_in`, `break_out`, `sign_out` — server `created_at` UTC.
- Reject punch sequences that skip required states unless manager override (audit log).
- Pagination on events, screenshots, reports.
- Background job for PDF generation; do not block request threads on matplotlib.
